(7762497, 1286183, 114285, '<td valign="top">I quite like this one, but, and there''s a BIG but. Did you consider cloning out the thingamajig to the right, my eye is drawn there and it''s not that exciting. The gradient you added or may have not added, up top, is very heavy handed. I would of lightened it somewhat because what''s happened in the meantime is the high contrasty effect on the trees. You might not agree with all this and that''s ok, but I thought I would comment IMHO.